      <p>「たゞの<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7871-7886"><rb>人</rb><rt>ひと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7886-7919">でないとはいひながら、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7919-7937"><rb>今日</rb><rt>けふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7937-7943">まで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7943-7961"><rb>養</rb><rt>やしな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7961-7964">ひ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7964-7979"><rb>育</rb><rt>そだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7979-7994">てたわしを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7994-8009"><rb>親</rb><rt>おや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8009-8012">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8012-8027"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8027-8069">つて、わしのいふことをきいて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8069-8084"><rb>貰</rb><rt>もら</rt></ruby>ひたい」</p>
