      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-20804-20828">といひました。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20828-20843"><rb>皆</rb><rt>みな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20843-20855">がそれを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20855-20867"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20867-20876">ると、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20876-20906"><rb>子安貝</rb><rt>こやすがひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20906-20921">ではなくて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20921-20939"><rb>燕</rb><rt>つばめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20939-20942">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20942-20966"><rb>古糞</rb><rt>ふるくそ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20966-20987">でありました。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20987-21020"><rb>中納言</rb><rt>ちゆうなごん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21020-21035">はそれきり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21035-21050"><rb>腰</rb><rt>こし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21050-21053">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21053-21065"><rb>立</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21065-21074">たず、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21074-21092"><rb>氣病</rb><rt>きや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21092-21098">みも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21098-21113"><rb>加</rb><rt>くは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21113-21122">はつて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21122-21134"><rb>死</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21134-21161">んでしまひました。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21161-21182"><rb>五人</rb><rt>ごにん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21182-21233">のうちであまりものいりもしなかつた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21233-21248"><rb>代</rb><rt>かは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21248-21257">りに、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21257-21275"><rb>智慧</rb><rt>ちえ</rt></ruby><seg