      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-21412-21433">そのうちに、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21433-21463"><rb>赫映姫</rb><rt>かぐやひめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21463-21466">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21466-21481"><rb>並</rb><rt>なら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21481-21505">ぶものゝないほど</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21505-21523"><rb>美</rb><rt>うつく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21523-21538">しいといふ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21538-21556"><rb>噂</rb><rt>うはさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21556-21562">を、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21562-21577"><rb>時</rb><rt>とき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21577-21580">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21580-21598"><rb>帝</rb><rt>みかど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21598-21604">がお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21604-21616"><rb>聞</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21616-21634">きになつて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21634-21655"><rb>一人</rb><rt>ひとり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21655-21658">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-21658-21682"><rb>女官</rb><rt>じよかん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-21682-21690">に、</seg></p>
