      <p><seg source="#source-30445-30448">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30448-30463"><rb>竹</rb><rt>たけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30463-30466">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30466-30481"><rb>中</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30481-30487">から</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30487-30502"><rb>拾</rb><rt>ひろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30502-30514">つてこの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30514-30538"><rb>年月</rb><rt>としつき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30538-30541">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30541-30562"><rb>大事</rb><rt>だいじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30562-30565">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30565-30580"><rb>育</rb><rt>そだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30580-30592">てたわが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30592-30604"><rb>子</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30604-30610">を、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30610-30625"><rb>誰</rb><rt>だれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30625-30628">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30628-30643"><rb>迎</rb><rt>むか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30643-30649">へに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30649-30661"><rb>來</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30661-30673">ようとも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30673-30688"><rb>渡</rb><rt>わた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30688-30718">すものではない。もし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30718-30730"><rb>取</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30730-30736">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30736-30748"><rb>行</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-30748-30787">かれようものなら、わしこそ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-30787-30799"><rb>死</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby>んでしまひませう」</p>
